{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06587","headline":"秦中初霁献给事二首 一 · 储光羲","name":"秦中初霁献给事二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渭水收暮雨，处处多新泽。\n宫苑傍山明，云林带天碧。\n君子耸高驾，英声邈今昔。\n锵佩出中台，彯缨入仙掖。\n夙心幸清鉴，晚志欣良觌。\n鸣盗非足徵，愿言同下客。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}